  "contentHtml": "<p>이승윤 선생님께 배운 웹앱만들기가 재미있어 이것저것 만들어보고 있는 중입니다.&#160;</p><p>학생들에게 수업 종료 10분 전에 활동지 정리 하면서 웹앱으로 이것저것 해보라고 하면</p><p>나름 재미있어 하면서 이해하기 좋다고 칭찬도 해주네요..&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>공유드립니다.&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzkvKDC6AftY-IH3TUUD-1Sy4kE9oYpvUbhpdUlShLzd6_Dnk_jBgr2Fx7QYtHhuEatUg/exec\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzkvKDC6AftY-IH3TUUD-1Sy4kE9oYpvUbhpdUlShLzd6_Dnk_jBgr2Fx7QYtHhuEatUg/exec</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"중학교 과학 - 시력 교정 시뮬레이터\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"script.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzkvKDC6AftY-IH3TUUD-1Sy4kE9oYpvUbhpdUlShLzd6_Dnk_jBgr2Fx7QYtHhuEatUg/exec\" data-og-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzkvKDC6AftY-IH3TUUD-1Sy4kE9oYpvUbhpdUlShLzd6_Dnk_jBgr2Fx7QYtHhuEatUg/exec\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzkvKDC6AftY-IH3TUUD-1Sy4kE9oYpvUbhpdUlShLzd6_Dnk_jBgr2Fx7QYtHhuEatUg/exec\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzkvKDC6AftY-IH3TUUD-1Sy4kE9oYpvUbhpdUlShLzd6_Dnk_jBgr2Fx7QYtHhuEatUg/exec\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">중학교 과학 - 시력 교정 시뮬레이터</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">script.google.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
